# Misc - Time Line Battle: three 5x5 boards, all moveable for white. Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,280);
# row 7 of the mode list (690,574); Play (808,712). Boards are 163 px at x 619..781, y 148 / 353 / 557
# (32.7 px squares). After the first move a new board appears and the camera recentres: the left column is then
# at x 517..679 (so the middle and bottom pawns are clicked at x=598). Submit is (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 280        # Versus
wait 30
click 690 574        # Misc - Time Line Battle (row 7)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
capture game-battle-start
click 700 295        # top board, centre white pawn
wait 60
capture game-battle-pawn-selected
click 700 263        # one step forward
wait 40
click 598 468        # middle board, centre white pawn
wait 40
click 598 434
wait 40
click 598 638        # bottom board, centre white pawn
wait 40
click 598 605
wait 60
capture game-battle-three-moves
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-battle-white-submitted
click 868 229        # black pawn on the top-right board (x 721..883)
wait 40
click 868 262
wait 60
capture game-battle-black-move
